Package: poulsbo-sgx-userspace
Version: 1.0.0
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: i386
Depends: libc6, libx11-6
Recommends: poulsbo-sgx-modules, xserver-xorg-core-hwe-18.04
Maintainer: Poulsbo project <marcinkeviciusjustinas@gmail.com>
Description: Poulsbo SGX535 userspace: EGL/GLES2 runtime, WSEGL, EXA DDX
 The userspace half of the Poulsbo SGX535 graphics stack:
  * the closed Intel EMGD 1.18 (DDK 1.5.15.3226) EGL / OpenGL ES 2.0 / OpenVG
    runtime, installed under /opt/emgd/lib;
  * the zero-copy page-flip WSEGL (libemgdPVR2D_DRIWSEGL) that presents SGX
    render straight into the scanned-out buffer via eglSwapBuffers;
  * srvinit's client libraries; and
  * the open EXA 2D acceleration X driver xf86-video-gma500blt, plus an
    xorg.conf.d snippet that selects it.
 .
 The EMGD components are proprietary Intel/Imagination binaries redistributed
 here for personal use on Poulsbo hardware; they are not open source.
 .
 Needs the poulsbo-sgx-modules package (the SGX kernel driver) to do anything.
